  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of parabola which cuts the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></math> orthogonally having the same axis and length of latus rectum as&nbsp;<math><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi></math>, is",
